"How are you doing?"

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:56.180
Hey, Ph.D.

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:00.020
Your alternate worlds will always overlap and never interfere

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:02.770
That blows my mind

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:08.400
Things get harder when they cool

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:12.870
Things melt when they're heated

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:15.160
This world is so full of rules,

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:18.750
it's going to drive me crazy

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:23.130
One dimension, two dimensions, three dimensions

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:27.010
A supernova is spreading from west to east

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.720
Easy game, easy game,

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:31.260
too easy game

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:35.720
The way there is fine, but what about coming back?

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.940
A dream of a never-ending dream

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:44.980
A wonderful, milky kiss

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:52.070
Will this universe expand forever?

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:10.090
<b>Next time:
"I Can't Be the Only One, Baby."</b>
